Z||000000||Shaun41178||05-02-2001||11:58 PM||||Ok I know it was somebody on here that was asking me if I knew of anyone that made head studs for the aluminum head V6.  Ok well I found the part numbers today<P>GM # 10051174 is for the head stud kit<P>Gm # 10051173 is for the 8 short studs<P>GM # 10051172 is for the 8 long studs<P>GM # 10048636 is for the 16 (11MM) nuts<P>GM # 10051155 is for the 16 washers<P>Now I don't know if these parts have been discontinued or not but at least it gives you a place to look.  Hope this helps<BR><P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
